cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: c5xtools
abstract: >-
  A modern, dependency-free, clean-room toolchain for the Texas Instruments
  TMS320C5x family of fixed-point DSPs: an assembler, a linker, a hex/ROM
  converter and a disassembler, written in portable C99, with output
  byte-compatible with the original TI tools.
type: software
authors:
